  "abstract": "This submission explores the impact of reducing the neuron embedding dimension from 8 to 4 within the Shared MLP with Embeddings, Bias, and Global Context architecture. The objective is to determine if a smaller embedding size is sufficient or more optimal for capturing neuron-specific characteristics in the ZAPBench dataset, potentially reducing model complexity and improving generalization. This is an ablation study on the neuron_embedding_dim hyperparameter.",
